  english:
    title: ABCF Type Fire Estinguisher
    message: ABCF-type fire extinguishers are suitable for solid, liquid, gas, and
      cooking oil fires. They are especially effective in kitchen environments. Proper
      distance and controlled application are essential to ensure safety.
    sound: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 380201cd159c73042a1e054683254514, type: 2}
  turkish:
    title: "ABCF Tipi Yang\u0131n T\xFCp\xFC"
    message: "ABCF tipi yang\u0131n t\xFCpleri, kat\u0131, s\u0131v\u0131, gaz ve
      ya\u011F yang\u0131nlar\u0131nda kullan\u0131labilir. \xD6zellikle mutfaklarda
      olu\u015Fan ya\u011F yang\u0131nlar\u0131na kar\u015F\u0131 etkilidir. Yanl\u0131\u015F
      m\xFCdahale riskini azaltmak i\xE7in do\u011Fru mesafeden uygulanmal\u0131d\u0131r."
